    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesnt feel temporary though. it feels permanent. like i've reached the end of my chapter and the book is just... continuing without me. everyone else is so busy living, so caught up in all this noise, and i'm just tired of trying to catch up to a world that doesn't want me. it's like i'm just taking up space that used to belong to someone who actually mattered.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
