      "content": "Feeling like a constant part of your life without a connection or purpose can lead to deep loneliness. Since these feelings seem persistent, it is important that you reach out to someone who can listen without judgment, such as a therapist or a trusted loved one. Do not let this sense of permanence convince you that the feeling is actually what your life looks like; professional support can help you re-ground yourself in your current reality. Please prioritize reaching out soon, as you deserve a space where you are actively valued and heard.",
      "source": "target",
